                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "@JanaeStracke @heritage_action\n\"Physicians take an oath to, first and foremost, \u2018do no harm\u2019 to their patients. For millions of health care providers in our country, performing abortions violates that essential oath and undermines their personal commitment to preserving human life. The Biden Administration is once again abusing executive authority to force pro-Life doctors to carry out the Left\u2019s abortion agenda\u2014directly attacking the rights and conscious protections of providers who adhere to their oath. Heritage Action applauds Sen. Lankford for introducing the Conscience Protection Act and encourages all conservative members to support this legislation\"",
