                "text": "Skyrocketing prescription drug prices are hurting families. I continue to pressure Pharmacy Benefit Managers (PBMs) \u2013 the middlemen in drug pricing \u2013 to lower costs and provide transparency. Congress must pass comprehensive PBM reforms to protect patients.",
